---
/**
 * The engraved bowl-of-spaghetti illustration — a self-contained dark bowl on
 * a transparent background, so the single image works in both themes: it
 * blends into the dark theme and reads as a rich inset on the light theme.
 * Decorative (alt=""); the trigger's accessible name is the title text beside it.
 */
---

<img
  src="/spaghetti.png"
  alt=""
  width="520"
  height="520"
  loading="lazy"
  decoding="async"
  class="mx-auto block w-full"
/>
